{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some games let you get away with things. Bad positioning, lucky shots, carrying your team on individual skill alone. Trivals doesn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3v3 competitive sport built entirely on real ball physics \u2014 every angle, every pass, every collision behaves exactly as it should. There is no auto-aim. No random outcomes. The ball doesn't lie about what you did wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is a living creature. The Elderball only arms itself through coordinated team passes. And the Guardian you're trying to destroy? It watches how you play, and it evolves to stop you. The closer you get to winning, the harder that becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you've ever wanted a competitive game that actually demands mastery \u2014 this is what that looks like.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASS TO CHARGE: Teamwork is Lethal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Trivals</strong>, the lone wolf dies. The Elderball lies dormant until it is shared. Snap a pass to your teammate to ignite the ball with volatile energy. That glow isn\u2019t just for show\u2014it\u2019s the ammunition you need to win.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rule:</strong> If you don't pass, you don't power up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/5617ac2c5d38035c795b16f30c53f18f.poster.avif?t=1772567787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/5617ac2c5d38035c795b16f30c53f18f.webm?t=1772567787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/5617ac2c5d38035c795b16f30c53f18f.mp4?t=1772567787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STRIKE THE GUARDIAN'S WEAK POINTS: Shatter the Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once charged, the ball becomes a heavy projectile. Hurl it with precision at the enemy\u2019s <strong>Towering Guardian</strong>. Aim for the glowing runes and unleash a devastating impact that shatters stone and magic alike.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Payoff:</strong> Feel the weight of the hit as the Guardian recoils and the rune explodes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/5eafc4b62dda8dc529cb8ff4a8731a57.poster.avif?t=1772567787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/5eafc4b62dda8dc529cb8ff4a8731a57.webm?t=1772567787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/5eafc4b62dda8dc529cb8ff4a8731a57.mp4?t=1772567787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INTERCEPT &amp; RESET: Defense Flips the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense in Trivals is active, skill-based, and heartbreaking for your opponents. Read the trajectory, dash into the air, and intercept a fully charged ball before it strikes your Guardian. The moment you catch it, their charge instantly dissipates into smoke.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Counter:</strong> You didn't just stop a goal; you erased their hard work. Now, it's your turn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/b13d36766fd746dfeb85bce3f2664616.poster.avif?t=1772567787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/b13d36766fd746dfeb85bce3f2664616.webm?t=1772567787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCALATING CHAOS: The Guardian Evolves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't a static sports arena; it\u2019s a boss fight. As you shatter runes and push for victory, the <strong>Towering Guardian</strong> adapts to survive. It gains new abilities specifically designed to block your charged shots\u2014raising energy shields, shifting its weak points, or deflecting projectiles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Challenge:</strong> The more you hurt it, the harder it becomes to land the final blow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/db5ccb651233eddab2c3e358729b4520.poster.avif?t=1772567787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/db5ccb651233eddab2c3e358729b4520.webm?t=1772567787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/db5ccb651233eddab2c3e358729b4520.mp4?t=1772567787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2532110?t=1772567787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/c628fb6826211d986733a4c9e48763e20db5fbb1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772567787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/48557b3a7fd0250f0fcfed6eba0f2146a7acd5f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772567787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/48557b3a7fd0250f0fcfed6eba0f2146a7acd5f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772567787","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some games let you get away with things. Bad positioning, lucky shots, carrying your team on individual skill alone. Trivals doesn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3v3 competitive sport built entirely on real ball physics \u2014 every angle, every pass, every collision behaves exactly as it should. There is no auto-aim. No random outcomes. The ball doesn't lie about what you did wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is a living creature. The Elderball only arms itself through coordinated team passes. And the Guardian you're trying to destroy? It watches how you play, and it evolves to stop you. The closer you get to winning, the harder that becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you've ever wanted a competitive game that actually demands mastery \u2014 this is what that looks like.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PASS TO CHARGE: Teamwork is Lethal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Trivals</strong>, the lone wolf dies. The Elderball lies dormant until it is shared. Snap a pass to your teammate to ignite the ball with volatile energy. That glow isn\u2019t just for show\u2014it\u2019s the ammunition you need to win.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Rule:</strong> If you don't pass, you don't power up.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532110/extras/561